  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> là đỉnh hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì vật đứng yên tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/199